		(descr "EIA 3216 (Case A) SMD tantalum chip capacitor land pattern. POLARIZED: pad 1 (at x=-1.20) = ANODE (+), pad 2 (at x=+1.20) = CATHODE (-), confirmed from the CA45-A010K226T (C122643) manufacturer datasheet (Hunan Xiangyee, Sec.9 Marking: dark/copper case stripe = positive-electrode marking) cross-checked against the EasyEDA source schematic symbol's own '+' polarity graphic, which sits on the pin-1 side (librarian P3 fix 2026-08-27, orchestrator-approved). Reverse-mounting a tantalum cap on a live rail can fail short/burn - do not remove the polarity mark below.")
